{"4237340":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"The City Life","steam_appid":4237340,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Life<\/strong> is an open-world life simulation and vehicle-building sandbox set in a modern British town. Start with nothing, take jobs, earn money, buy garages and homes, build and modify vehicles, and work your way into the proper city lifestyle.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠 Core Gameplay<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin living in a small trailer community<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take paid jobs: parcel delivery, bin collection, post service, taxi runs, bus routes, hydrant maintenance and more<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn wages and daily allowances from the Job Centre<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy vehicles, maintain them, and customise parts<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade from a small shed to full auto garage ownership<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚗 Vehicles &amp; Building<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, buy, repair, and assemble vehicles part-by-part<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyres, engines, batteries, panels, interiors and tuning upgrades<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic car physics and handling<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tow, scrap, sell, and rebuild<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏙 Open-World Living<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore shops, petrol stations, garages, housing districts<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase apartments, garages, work bays<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay rent, maintain property, and keep them before eviction timers expire<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 Multiplayer<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated multiplayer server support<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player has individual missions, wages, garages, and home waypoints<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌧 Simulation Systems<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC routines (work, sleep, relax, eat)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economy with shops, repairs, property rental and resale<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Life<\/strong> is an open-world life simulation and vehicle-building sandbox set in a modern British town. Start with nothing, take jobs, earn money, buy garages and homes, build and modify vehicles, and work your way into the proper city lifestyle.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠 Core Gameplay<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin living in a small trailer community<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take paid jobs: parcel delivery, bin collection, post service, taxi runs, bus routes, hydrant maintenance and more<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn wages and daily allowances from the Job Centre<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy vehicles, maintain them, and customise parts<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade from a small shed to full auto garage ownership<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚗 Vehicles &amp; Building<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, buy, repair, and assemble vehicles part-by-part<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyres, engines, batteries, panels, interiors and tuning upgrades<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic car physics and handling<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tow, scrap, sell, and rebuild<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏙 Open-World Living<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore shops, petrol stations, garages, housing districts<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase apartments, garages, work bays<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay rent, maintain property, and keep them before eviction timers expire<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 Multiplayer<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated multiplayer server support<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every player has individual missions, wages, garages, and home waypoints<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌧 Simulation Systems<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC routines (work, sleep, relax, eat)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economy with shops, repairs, property rental and resale<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"A British open-world life sim where you start with nothing, take jobs, build vehicles, buy property, pay rent, and work your way up from trailer park to full city living.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4237340\/c5ae2f4420a55b9e98d0414e98797ad643380c8e\/header.jpg?t=1793637535","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4237340\/42f9312c48a2c0ab89aad18822473d085e1d4e4f\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793637535","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4237340\/42f9312c48a2c0ab89aad18822473d085e1d4e4f\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793637535","website":"https:\/\/discord.gg\/V4M9JQ35ap","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 \/ AMD RX 580 (6GB VRAM)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 15 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> SSD recommended for optimal streaming performance.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i7-9700K \/ AMD Ryzen 7 3700X<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA RTX 2070 \/ AMD RX 6700 XT (8GB+ VRAM)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 35 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> SSD required. Ray tracing optional.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"025 Stoner Games Studio. All rights reserved.<br \/>\r\nCity Life™ and associated logos are trademarks of Stoner Games Studio.<br \/>\r\nDeveloped using Unreal® Engine 5, © Epic Games, Inc.","developers":["SGS"],"publishers":["SGS"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":1499,"final":1499,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$14.99"},"packages":[1483397],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy The City Life","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1483397,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"The City Life - $14.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":1499}]}],"platforms":{"wi